# The pause menu's VR Hands (0.1.8) by the sticks: pause, down to Options, into it, down past VR Options to VR Hands,
# into it; Gun angle stepped up once and down twice (5 down), down to Gun size and stepped down twice (80 percent), down
# to Hand size and stepped up once and down twice (90 percent). The right hand is gone, so the sticks move the cursor
